# Gameplay rules

- 10 targets per round.
- 3 shots per volley.
- Game A spawns 1 target per volley.
- Game B spawns 2 targets per volley.
- Game C spawns 2 clay targets per volley.
- Hits trigger a micro-reveal during gameplay.
- Review screen shows full tweets in shot order.
- The playfield should stay uncluttered during active play.
